WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.968
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show"!

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:04.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:07.334
Thank you.

00:00:07.334 --> 00:00:08.767
Welcome, everybody.

00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:12.200
Well, guys, Russia's invasion
of Ukraine continued today.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.267
In a controversial
new interview,

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:18.901
former President Trump said
Vladimir Putin is very savvy

00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:20.634
and called his strategy genius.

00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:22.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.534
Keep in mind, Trump also used
the word "savvy" and "genius"

00:00:24.534 --> 00:00:26.734
to describe
McDonald's dollar menu, so...

00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:28.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:30.734
Honestly, I'm not sure you want
to be called a genius by the guy

00:00:30.734 --> 00:00:32.000
who clogged
the White House toilet

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.367
with classified documents.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:37.534
"Just flush it."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.534 --> 00:00:38.968
Well, everyone's
been talking about this.

00:00:38.968 --> 00:00:42.000
Buckingham Palace announced
that Queen Elizabeth has COVID

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.300
and is dealing
with mild symptoms.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.868
When asked how she was feeling,
the Queen said,

00:00:46.868 --> 00:00:49.467
"Well, we're not talking about
Prince Andrew, so a lot better."

00:00:49.467 --> 00:00:52.067
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:53.767
So far, the Queen said
the worst symptom

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:55.634
is Prince Charles coming in
every four seconds

00:00:55.634 --> 00:00:57.067
to see how she's doing.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:59.767
"You doing okay, Mom?
Okay.

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:01.400
I don't think you need
that booster, mum.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:03.167
I think you can really tough
your way through this one."

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:05.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.634
Some entertainment news.
This year, the Oscars

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:10.767
are planning to pre-record
some awards before the ceremony

00:01:10.767 --> 00:01:13.534
and air them
during the live broadcast.

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:15.334
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:15.334 --> 00:01:17.434
Even more insulting, before
the awards are presented,

00:01:17.434 --> 00:01:19.234
the announcer will say,
"And now the categories

00:01:19.234 --> 00:01:22.801
nobody cares about."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.801 --> 00:01:24.367
If they really want
to shorten the broadcast,

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:26.033
maybe just skip the part
where someone explains

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:31.100
what an actor is.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.767
"An actor acts."

00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:36.100
Some business news --
I read that Peloton

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:39.434
had a secret initiative
called Project Tinman

00:01:39.434 --> 00:01:43.701
where they hid rust on bikes
that were sent out to customers.

00:01:43.701 --> 00:01:45.367
And somehow
this has been the best news

00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:48.868
about Peloton all year.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.868 --> 00:01:50.200
It's actually good news
because it means

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:51.534
Big didn't die
of a heart attack.

00:01:51.534 --> 00:01:56.067
He died of tetanus.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:59.100
Yeah, come on.
He looked healthy.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.367
Now I get it.

00:02:01.367 --> 00:02:03.267
Hey, I heard that IHOP
just launched its first

00:02:03.267 --> 00:02:07.200
plant-based sandwich at one
location in New York City.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:09.434
Yeah, it's for all the people
who sit down at breakfast like,

00:02:09.434 --> 00:02:12.334
"Do I want the fudge pancakes
or the mung-bean sandwich?

00:02:12.334 --> 00:02:14.300
Uh..."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.601
Can't be fun eating a vegan
sandwich while the person

00:02:16.601 --> 00:02:18.734
across from you sprays whipped
cream on his breakfast.

00:02:18.734 --> 00:02:20.300
You know what I'm saying?
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:23.067
Speaking of plant-based food,
Kraft Heinz just announced

00:02:23.067 --> 00:02:24.501
that it wants to make
plant-based

00:02:24.501 --> 00:02:26.133
Oscar Mayer hot dogs.

00:02:26.133 --> 00:02:27.400
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.801
Oscar Mayer said they care about
the environment,

00:02:29.801 --> 00:02:32.667
then they kept driving across
the country in a giant hot dog

00:02:32.667 --> 00:02:34.100
that gets 3 miles a gallon.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:35.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.934 --> 00:02:38.234
Well, this is going viral.
A news reporter in Ohio

00:02:38.234 --> 00:02:41.334
was out in the field reporting
when he was surprised by someone

00:02:41.334 --> 00:02:43.300
he knows pretty well.
Take a look at this.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.300
-It's because of --

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:49.467
This is my mom.
Hold on.

00:02:49.467 --> 00:02:50.634
-Uh-oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.634 --> 00:02:53.334
-Hi, baby!
-[ Laughing ]

00:02:53.334 --> 00:02:54.901
-I'm trying to work right now,
and you over there

00:02:54.901 --> 00:02:56.534
calling my phone.
This is Deangelo.

00:02:56.534 --> 00:02:58.234
You can say hi.
-Hi, Deangelo!

00:02:58.234 --> 00:03:00.968
-And don't be holding up traffic
because you got cars behind you.

00:03:00.968 --> 00:03:04.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.033 --> 00:03:10.434
[ Cheers and applause ]
-That's not bad.

00:03:10.434 --> 00:03:12.033
Then his mom threw it in reverse
and was like,

00:03:12.033 --> 00:03:14.767
"I got some breaking news!
Mommy loves you!"

00:03:14.767 --> 00:03:18.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.968 --> 00:03:21.634
Get this -- a new study
found that dinosaurs

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:24.701
actually used to get
respiratory infections.

00:03:24.701 --> 00:03:26.234
I guess that explains
the latest trailer

00:03:26.234 --> 00:03:27.901
I just saw for
the "Jurassic World" movie.

00:03:27.901 --> 00:03:29.534
Watch this.

00:03:29.534 --> 00:03:33.133
♪♪

00:03:33.133 --> 00:03:34.868
-[ Cough ]

00:03:34.868 --> 00:03:36.767
-Coming this summer...

00:03:36.767 --> 00:03:39.601
-[ Coughing, groans ]

00:03:39.601 --> 00:03:42.434
-...experience
the epic conclusion.

00:03:42.434 --> 00:03:46.367
-[ Coughing ]
-[ Clears throat ]

00:03:46.367 --> 00:03:48.601
-"Jurassic World: Dominion."

00:03:48.601 --> 00:03:51.667
In -- [ Clears throat ] --
theaters -- [ Coughs ] --

00:03:51.667 --> 00:03:52.834
June 10th.
[ Coughing ]

00:03:52.834 --> 00:03:55.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:59.634
-Now I --
Now I understand that.

00:03:59.634 --> 00:04:03.067
And, finally, parking here
in New York City can be hard,

00:04:03.067 --> 00:04:05.200
but I think this guy
found a new way to do it.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.734
Look at this.

00:04:06.734 --> 00:04:08.634
Look at this --
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.634 --> 00:04:12.200
Look at that photo.
Oh, my gosh.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.234
You know
a third car drove by like,

00:04:14.234 --> 00:04:15.901
"I bet I could
squeeze in between..."

00:04:15.901 --> 00:04:18.767
[ Laughter ]

00:04:18.767 --> 00:04:20.400
It'll be even weirder
in nine months

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.467
when the Toyota
gives birth to a smart car.

